  "content": "<p>允許資源包添加連接紋理、自發光渲染等功能。一個為原版及部分精選模組添加這些效果的資源包可在<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ctp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>更多資訊請參閱<a href=\"https://github.com/Chisel-Team/ConnectedTexturesMod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>CTM 現已擁有<a href=\"http://discord.gg/0vVjLvWg5kyQwnHG\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>！&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>此模組為<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/chisel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel</a>的前置模組。</p>",
